// Title: Kernel callbacks by owner
// Why: Who is notified of process, thread and image-load events. Every EDR registers process-creation callbacks; if an EDR driver is loaded but has no PspCreateProcessNotifyRoutine entry, it may have been blinded (EDRSandblast, RTCore64-based killers).
// FalsePositives: Callback counts differ per build and installed software; compare against a clean image of the same build.
// MITRE: T1562.001
callbacks
| summarize Callbacks = count(), Types = make_set(Type) by Module
| extend Unresolved = Module in ("", "-", "N/A")
| order by Unresolved desc, Callbacks desc
